GsSpiritFlame.Desc: Reforged: spirit flames trail pale soulfire; half of their hits split off a hunting wisp
GsSpiritFlameRingProj.DisplayName: Spirit Flame Ring
GsSpiritFlameWispProj.DisplayName: Hunting Wisp
GsPoisonStaff.Desc: Reforged: fangs trail venom mist and split into thin fangs on their second bite
GsVenomStaff.Desc: Reforged: fangs trail venom mist and split a heavy fang on their second bite
GsShadowFlameHexDoll.Desc: Reforged: shadowflame tendrils pin a hex brand into whatever they touch; branded foes take more from this doll
GsLeafBlower.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: leaf blades spin with a razor-green wake
	Hold right click to charge Storm Mode: for six seconds every leaf flies faster, cuts deeper and spirals harder
	'''
GsMorphFangSerpentProj.DisplayName: Serpent Kiss
GsMorphFangAcidPoolProj.DisplayName: Acid Pool
GsShadowFlameHexSigilProj.DisplayName: Grand Hex Sigil
